1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:04,667
Here. So you won't embarrass
yourself before your fiancé.

2
00:00:04,667 --> 00:00:08,167
Wow! I've got new panties!

3
00:00:08,167 --> 00:00:09,467
[IMA GIGGLING]

4
00:00:09,467 --> 00:00:10,733
Hey, wait.

5
00:00:10,733 --> 00:00:13,300
Did you drink vinegar
or something?

6
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,067
You're so giddy
it's making me cringe!

7
00:00:15,067 --> 00:00:16,300
Oh, Ima!

8
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:17,500
But you know what?

9
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,333
I think Papa Ping and I
are doing okay.

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,033
I'm getting confused.

11
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,633
I thought this was all
just for show.

12
00:00:25,467 --> 00:00:26,667
But now...

13
00:00:27,567 --> 00:00:30,400
I think I want a future
with him.

14
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,000
[SQUEALS]

15
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,233
Oh, dear...

16
00:00:35,267 --> 00:00:36,333
[JUNE] This is nice.

17
00:00:36,333 --> 00:00:39,467
June, let me
tell you something.

18
00:00:40,567 --> 00:00:42,367
Be careful with your heart.

19
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:45,200
You're only just starting
to fall for someone,

20
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:47,133
and you're already
about to get married.

21
00:00:47,133 --> 00:00:51,700
Ima, I know you're here
to guard the gate to my heart.

22
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:55,633
But wouldn't it be better
if we actually liked each other

23
00:00:55,633 --> 00:00:57,100
before getting married?

24
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:58,533
There's nothing wrong
with that.

25
00:00:58,533 --> 00:01:00,400
It's even better, isn't it?

26
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:03,300
But it'd be much better
if you both feel the same way.

27
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:05,000
Does he love you too?

28
00:01:05,333 --> 00:01:07,567
Ouch! That hurts!

29
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,833
I'm leaving.
My own mom's hurting me.

30
00:01:09,833 --> 00:01:14,133
You know I've told you
over and over.

31
00:01:14,633 --> 00:01:16,367
You don't have to do this.

32
00:01:16,367 --> 00:01:20,200
We can always find another way.

33
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,600
Ima...

34
00:01:22,167 --> 00:01:25,167
We've spent our whole lives
trying to make things work.

35
00:01:25,167 --> 00:01:26,600
But nothing ever changes.

36
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:30,367
We're in a losing battle
with the system.

37
00:01:30,367 --> 00:01:33,367
No matter how hard we work,
how much we hustle,

38
00:01:33,367 --> 00:01:35,267
or how much we save,
it's never enough.

39
00:01:35,267 --> 00:01:37,167
You know,
you could be president.

40
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:39,633
Really, sweetheart.
You're amazing.

41
00:01:40,667 --> 00:01:42,233
But seriously...

42
00:01:42,233 --> 00:01:44,433
What I don't want

43
00:01:44,433 --> 00:01:46,700
is for you to sacrifice
your heart.

44
00:01:47,533 --> 00:01:49,633
True love has no price.

45
00:01:50,267 --> 00:01:53,467
Ima, I watched you work
yourself to the bone

46
00:01:53,467 --> 00:01:57,700
just to raise me
and help our relatives,

47
00:01:57,700 --> 00:02:00,100
even when you had nothing left.

48
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:04,833
So if this is the only way
to give you a better life,

49
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:08,600
then I'm all in, Ima.

50
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:11,633
I'd even put my heart
on the line for you.

51
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:17,733
Alright.
You should head back now.

52
00:02:17,733 --> 00:02:20,633
We might both end up crying
if we stay here any longer.

53
00:02:20,633 --> 00:02:22,500
I'll come visit you the day
after tomorrow.

54
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:24,700
I'll bring your favorite food,
okay?

55
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:28,467
- Okay.
- Thanks for the panties!

56
00:02:28,467 --> 00:02:30,667
Sweetheart,
wash them first, okay?

57
00:02:30,667 --> 00:02:32,300
I bought them at a thrift shop.

58
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:33,767
Oh. Ima, I'm touched,

59
00:02:33,767 --> 00:02:35,467
but why do these look
like your size?

60
00:02:35,467 --> 00:02:37,500
I tried them on.
Well... they didn't fit.

61
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:39,700
I tried them on, so
you'd better wash them first.

62
00:02:39,700 --> 00:02:40,700
- Thanks, Ima.
- Alright.

63
00:02:40,700 --> 00:02:43,133
- Bye, Ima. See you.
- Scrub them by hand.

64
00:02:43,133 --> 00:02:45,300
- Don't use the washing machine.
- Okay.

65
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:50,333
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

66
00:02:50,367 --> 00:02:51,600
[IMA] Fernando...

67
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:53,900
<i>I know they'll do everything
they can to June</i>

68
00:02:53,900 --> 00:02:55,600
<i> once the truth comes out.</i>

69
00:02:56,867 --> 00:02:59,467
<i> They'll take away her rights.</i>

70
00:03:01,233 --> 00:03:04,167
<i>But I never expected June
to fall for the very person</i>

71
00:03:04,167 --> 00:03:05,700
<i> who could end up hurting her.</i>

72
00:03:05,700 --> 00:03:08,300
[MOROSE MUSIC CONTINUES]
